* Description

  Device tree for Android 5.1 (CM 12.1) on Samsung Galaxy Xcover 2
  (GT-S7710, a.k.a. skomer).
  Work in progress. Based on the CM 11 tree by flxo, with parts taken
  from the sibling platform "golden" (Galaxy S3 Mini GT-I8190).

  Platform changes (frameworks/base, frameworks/av, frameworks/native,
  system/core, build, Camera2, Settings, Telephony) are NOT forked.
  They are stored here as git patches in patches/ and applied with
  patches/apply.sh.

* How To Build

  - Make a workspace

  $ mkdir -p ~/android/lineage
  $ cd ~/android/lineage


  - Do repo init

  $ repo init -u https://github.com/LineageOS/android.git -b cm-12.1


  - Create .repo/local_manifests/skomer.xml with the following content:

  <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
  <manifest>
      <remote name="egor" fetch="https://github.com/egorgr82" />
      <project name="android_device_samsung_skomer" path="device/samsung/skomer" remote="egor" revision="skomer-5.1" />
      <project name="kernel_samsung_skomer" path="kernel/samsung/skomer" remote="egor" revision="l51" />
      <project name="android_vendor_samsung_skomer" path="vendor/samsung/skomer" remote="egor" revision="l51" />
  </manifest>


  - Sync

  $ repo sync


  - Apply platform patches (once, on a clean tree)

  $ bash device/samsung/skomer/patches/apply.sh


  - Setup environment

  $ source build/envsetup.sh
  $ lunch cm_skomer-userdebug


  - Build

  $ export USE_CCACHE=1
  $ mka bacon

* Notes

  patches/golden-reference contains patches from the golden tree
  (NovaFusion), kept for reference only. They are not applied.

